<newsitem itemid="386062" id="root" date="1997-02-18" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: Sedgwick year pre-tax rises to 95.5 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Sedgwick year pre-tax rises to 95.5 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr  (pence)		11.6		   vs 12.6</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)  6.5		    vs 6.5</p>
<p> Turnover		    914.9		  vs 880.9</p>
<p> Pretax			95.5		   vs 91.2</p>
<p> Operating result	  100.3		  vs 90.3</p>
<p> Interest/invest income  45.4		   vs 50.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 92 and 98.1 million stg. Including a foreign income enhancement of 0.75p paid at the interim stage, the total dividend for the year was 7.25 p per share.</p>
<p>Full company name - Sedgwick Group Plc</p>
</text>
